docs/implementation.md:5:- `packages/token-exchange`: runtime-neutral token exchange factory and Web request handler; owns composition snapshots, authentication, authorization, issuance, routing semantics, bounded bodies, caches, and sanitized observation events
docs/implementation.md:6:- `packages/fastify`: encapsulated Fastify v5 `/token` adapter with raw form parsing and explicit Web Response translation
